                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I kinda loved [i]Myst V[/i], in spite of its rough edges, until I fell victim to a known, game-breaking bug. It seems I could reload and make up for an hour or so of lost progress, saving frequently in case the issue happens again, but y'know what? Nah. I'm good.\n\n[i]Myst[/i] is a masterpiece. [i]Obduction[/i] is proof that it wasn't a fluke. I'd love to play another game on their level someday, but the [i]Myst[/i] sequels have done nothing but break my heart.",
